{"id":"afb099c23f6ac9aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point.md","title":"ZFC Stationary Reflection Point","display":"df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point — ZFC Stationary Reflection Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point"],"display":"df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point — ZFC Stationary Reflection Point","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-stationary-reflection-point — ZFC Stationary Reflection Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,C,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\delta\\in V\">\\(S,C,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S,\\kappa)\">\\((S,\\kappa)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal and nonzero-limit-ordinal predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubOnOrdinal}_S,\\mathrm{StationaryOnOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubOnOrdinal}_S,\\mathrm{StationaryOnOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (local predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryReflectionPoint}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryReflectionPoint}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}club\\text{-}on\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClubOnOrdinal}_S(C,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land C\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in C\\;(\\beta\\in\\gamma)\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\delta=\\bigcup(C\\cap\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in C\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}club\\text{-}on\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClubOnOrdinal}_S(C,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land C\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in C\\;(\\beta\\in\\gamma)\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\delta=\\bigcup(C\\cap\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in C\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}on\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryOnOrdinal}_S(S,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\nS\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClubOnOrdinal}_S(C,\\lambda)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}on\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryOnOrdinal}_S(S,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\nS\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClubOnOrdinal}_S(C,\\lambda)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land\n\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)&gt;\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{StationaryOnOrdinal}_S(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land\n\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)&gt;\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{StationaryOnOrdinal}_S(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient stationary set still uses the registered predicate on the regular cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>. Reflection below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> uses a separate club/stationary definition on an arbitrary limit ordinal, so singular ordinals of uncountable cofinality are not incorrectly excluded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"targe